Creature and morale oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-10-16. See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA).
Adds OracleTraceWeighted to the draw trace (one entry per DistributeCreaturesByWeight pick: weight total and the lower
bound of the chosen bucket), a switch that stops CreatureAttackTown before it opens a battle (inactive unless the oracle
sets it) and moves the strategic morale decay counter of HourlyMoraleUpdate to file scope (same behaviour). Applied by
tools/oracle/build.sh after 0005.

